contentText:
Jelly Roll has been open with fans about the triumphs of his weight-loss journey &#8212; and now, he&#8217;s keeping that same energy with his setbacks.

In a recent vlog on his YouTube channel, the country star leveled with fans about having gained back some pounds in the months since he posed for the cover of Men&#8217;s Health . &#8220;I was like, &#8216;You know what, man? I&#8217;ve been working hard for the past three years losing this weight,'&#8221; he explained. &#8220;I said, &#8216;I&#8217;m gonna enjoy the holidays.'&#8221;

&#8220;I ate a big Thanksgiving meal, and I ate a big birthday meal, and I ate a big Christmas meal, and I kinda got off the rails,&#8221; Jelly continued. &#8220;I have, to some degree, lost my way.&#8221;

